            f"成功 {len(payload.get('fetched_symbols', []))} 只，"
            f"跳过 {len(payload.get('skipped_symbols', []))} 只，"
            f"缺失 {len(payload.get('missing_symbols', []))} 只，失败 {payload.get('failure_count', 0)} 项"
            f"{rows_note}。明细在结果的 rows 里，可用 read_tool_result 续读。"
